    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-ph/0111240v1</id>
    <title>Proton spin structure and the axial U(1) problem</title>
    <updated>2001-11-20T08:21:43Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-ph/0111240v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-ph/0111240v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>  We emphasise the relation between the spin structure of the proton and the axial U(1) problem. New experiments motivated by the proton spin problem which could shed light on the nature of U(1) symmetry breaking in QCD are discussed.</summary>
    <category term="hep-ph" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
